---

No Cloud Quick Share is built on the OpenXTalk extension family:

  - TorrentXT   (org.openxtalk.library.torrent)  - MIT; wraps libtorrent-rasterbar
                (BSD-3-Clause) and Boost (Boost Software License).
  - cryptoXT    (org.openxtalk.library.sodium)   - MIT; wraps libsodium (ISC).  Optional.
  - OnionXT                                       - MIT; Tor onion streams.      Optional.

Those extensions are separate projects under their own (permissive) licenses;
see each project for details.
